  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あわで　つつんだ　こいしを　なげる\nわざを　つかう。３０メートル　さきの\nあきかんに　あてる　コントロール。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "거품으로 싸인 돌멩이를 던지는\n기술을 쓴다. 30m 앞에 있는\n빈 캔을 맞출 정도로 컨트롤이 좋다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est capable de lancer des pierres recouvertes\nde mousse avec une précision suffisante pour toucher\nune canette vide à 30 m.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es kann kleine in Blasen gehüllte Steine mit solcher\nPräzision werfen, dass es selbst 30 m entfernte Dosen\nproblemlos trifft.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede lanzar piedras envueltas en burbujas con tal\npuntería, que acierta latas vacías a 30 metros de\ndistancia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lancia dei sassi racchiusi in bolle di schiuma.\nÈ talmente preciso da riuscire a colpire una lattina\nvuota a 30 m di distanza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It can throw bubble-covered pebbles with precise\ncontrol, hitting empty cans up to a hundred feet away.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "泡で　包んだ　小石を　投げる\n技を　使う。３０メートル　先の\n空き缶に　当てる　コントロール。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Puede lanzar piedras envueltas en burbujas con tal\npuntería, que acierta latas vacías a 30 metros de\ndistancia.",
      "language": {
